    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25789" root="ضرع" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِرْعٌ</span></b>  <i>A like; a similar person</i> or <i>thing;</i> (IAar,
O, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرْعٌ</span></b> : (IAar, TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صرع</span>:)
and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِرْعٌ</span> (O, TA) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرْعٌ</span>. (O and K and
TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صرع</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A sort,</i> or <i>species:</i> and
<i>a state, condition,</i> or <i>manner of being:</i> of a

thing: as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرْعٌ</span></b> : and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِرْعٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرْعٌ</span>.
(TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صرع</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A strand of a rope:</i>
(O, K:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِرْعٌ</span>: (O:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُرُوعٌ</span>. (O, K:
and the CK adds <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَضْرُعٌ</span>.)

